Lip makeup three-control enhancement
  core/lip_makeup/lib.rs is original GPL-3.0-or-later Lab control math.
  It modifies existing low/mid-frequency lip shading, not generated highlights.
  Landmark topology corresponds to MediaPipe face_mesh_connections.py:
  Copyright 2021 The MediaPipe Authors, Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe/blob/master/mediapipe/python/solutions/face_mesh_connections.py
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  Existing NumPy/OpenCV geometry, filtering and colour conversion are reused.
  RapidRetouch 5e9d9c1d2770ff29d11a3879e5a90aad5887e028 mouth tests were compared;
  its mouth.py implementation was unavailable and was not copied or reviewed.
  Source, license and limitations ship in third_party/lip_makeup/.

Original eyelash materials
  core/eyelash/eyelash.rs and eyelash_patterns.json define original procedural
  tapered fibres, GPL-3.0-or-later; no PixCake art or model weights are included.
  Observed eyelid index topology uses the existing MediaPipe Face Mesh mapping
  (The MediaPipe Authors, Apache-2.0); existing model licensing remains applicable.
  Source, licence, MediaPipe licence and integration limits ship together in
  lumaretouch_engine/third_party/eyelash/. Runtime/visual acceptance is UNRUN.

Colour grading (core/colour_grading): original Lumaretouch GPL-3.0-or-later
float32 tonal-mask grading. Vendor documentation informed control semantics;
no vendor code, LUTs, imagery or model weights are included. See
 docs/colour-grading/CONTRACT.md for domain and provenance limitations.

Selective colour (core/selective_colour): original Lumaretouch GPL-3.0-or-later
float32 RGB-family CMYK adjustments. Adobe/FFmpeg documentation informed control
semantics; no vendor code or assets are included. The nine-way partition and
additive black rule are original. See docs/selective-colour/CONTRACT.md.

RGB primary calibration: original Lumaretouch float32 xy-primary basis implementation, GPL-3.0-or-later. No third-party numerical implementation copied. Reference concepts: darktable RGB primaries documentation.

Photo grain: original Lumaretouch deterministic source-coordinate Rust kernel, GPL-3.0-or-later. No external texture or model. See docs/photo-grain/CONTRACT.md.
